.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH backup 1  "backup " 
.SH NAME
backup \- Write a backup archive (default: backups/forgehub\-backup\-<timestamp>.tar)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbackup\fR [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fINAME\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write a backup archive (default: backups/forgehub\-backup\-<timestamp>.tar)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-out\fR \fI<OUT>\fR
Output file instead of the default location
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fINAME\fR]
Back up only this snippet (plus the config)
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg backup
  fg backup \-\-out ~/forgehub\-backup.tar
